="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c93" value="예측" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Pretendard Variable;strokeWidth=1.6;strokeColor=#a8a8a8;fontColor=#525252;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c59" target="c62"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c94" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:#525252&#x27;&gt;입력 데이터 흐름&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:15px;color:#161616;line-height:1.6&#x27;&gt;MP4 18개 → Keypoint CSV → 사람 기준 분할 → Clip마다 1,140 Feature → Random Forest 학습 → Validation 확인 → 최종 Test&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=24;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=20;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f4f4f4;fontFamily=Pretendard Variable;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1056" width="1176" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c95" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.6px;color:#da1e28&#x27;&gt;정답 라벨 흐름&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:15px;color:#161616;line-height:1.6&#x27;&gt;action_classes.csv → 26번이 파일명 A ID로 찾아 붙임 → splits · sequences의 action_label 열 → y_train · y_true → true_label vs pred_label&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=24;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=20;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#fff1f1;fontFamily=Pretendard Variable;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1264" y="1056" width="1176" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c96" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:13px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.6&#x27;&gt;· 34번 좌표: 골반 중심을 (0, 0)으로 옮긴 뒤 어깨 폭으로 나눔 · 각도 4 = 양 팔꿈치 · 양 무릎 · Pose가 검출된 Frame만 쓰고 10 Frame 미만 Clip은 제외 · 35번 RandomForestClassifier(class_weight=balanced)&lt;br&gt;· 그림에서 뺀 코드 — 4일차 개념 실습 19~24 · 데이터 확인 25·28·31·33 · 자동 QA·사람 검수 27~29 · 누출 데모 32 · 분석·실험 37~39 · Mini Challenge 41 (학습 데이터를 바꾸지 않는 확인 단계) · 경로는 subject10_pose_action/ 기준&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Pretendard Variable;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1168" width="2376" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>